  "described": {
    "alt_text": "A Stable Diffusion landscape of rounded orange rock formations, a waterfall, a yellow farmhouse and a winding river through green hills toward a far lake.",
    "description": "A square generated image in a painterly animated style. A turquoise river winds from a lake in the distance down the left half through rolling green hills dotted with cypress like trees. On the right, tall orange and red rock columns and boulders rise beside a white waterfall that drops toward a red roofed cabin with a parked car. At lower right a yellow farmhouse with a dark red roof sits beside a dirt path. A small boat floats in the river, and a rust coloured bush fills the lower left corner. Blue hills and pale clouds fill the horizon.",
    "impression": "A gentler, more pastoral take, with a waterfall and a farmhouse giving it the feel of a holiday valley. The rock columns echo the commission's cliffs but have become sandstone. Like the other variations it is empty of the drawing's characters, a set without its cast.",
